Terminal: walk to terminal with a bearing loop (prompt as sensor).

Re-entry: after mining, the character is near the deposit (a few meters from the exit point); the ship is at pad center. Use the re-entry bearing loop from touch-onfoot (proven pattern). Prompt '[E] Enter ship' → interactPress → docked-indicator shown.

